Journal policies are linked to ACS primary sources. Article metadata and source locators
identify the original publications; this project's license does not relicense those papers.
No ACS endorsement or affiliation is implied.

Figure source discovery and local inspection use the PubMed Central Article Dataset,
provided by the U.S. National Library of Medicine (NLM), and associated Europe PMC records.
https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/tools/pmcaws/
The public registry records each source's DOI, version, license code, URL and digest.
Original article text and figure images are not redistributed in this repository.
Public figure observations are independently written descriptions; demonstration artwork
and evaluation datasets are original, synthetic examples, not scientific research results.
